title Cassette: REPLACE ORIGINAL in the save box asks once more: Delete the original take? with DELETE and CANCEL; Esc is CANCEL
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_PAGE trim
env CASSETTE_DEMO_BOX save
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
tap "REPLACE ORIGINAL"
wait 400
expect text "Delete the original take?"
expect text "DELETE"
shot confirm
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key esc
wait 300
expect notext "Delete the original take?"
expect text "SAVE AS NEW FILES"
say Esc answered no (confirm_answer no); the save box stays
key esc
wait 300
expect notext "SAVE AS NEW FILES"
expect text "POSITION"
expect noquit
